{
  "title": "KMS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "암호화 키를 만들고 사용 권한을 관리하는 서비스다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">KMS Keys and Data Keys</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#envelope-encryption\">Envelope Encryption</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#aws-owned-aws-managed-and-customer-managed-keys\">AWS Owned, AWS Managed and Customer Managed Keys</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#symmetric-asymmetric-and-hmac-keys\">Symmetric, Asymmetric and HMAC Keys</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#key-policies-iam-and-grants\">Key Policies, IAM and Grants</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#encryption-context\">Encryption Context</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#key-rotation-and-aliases\">Key Rotation and Aliases</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#multi-region-keys\">Multi-Region Keys</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#imported-material-and-custom-key-stores\">Imported Material and Custom Key Stores</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#disable-deletion-and-audit\">Disable, Deletion and Audit</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>31 / 62</span></div><h1>KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 10 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span>는 암호화 Key의 생성·사용·권한·감사를 관리한다. Key는 Ciphertext의 위치를 찾는 주소가 아니라, 암호 알고리즘이 데이터를 변환·복구할 때 쓰는 값이다.</p><p>대용량 데이터는 보통 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a>로 암호화하고 그 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a>를 KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> Key로 보호하는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#envelope-encryption\">Envelope Encryption</a>을 사용한다. 데이터 접근 권한과 KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> Decrypt 권한을 함께 설계해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Envelope Encryption\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Envelope Encryption</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Encrypt</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a></strong><small>일시적으로 Plaintext 사용</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Data → Ciphertext</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a>로 데이터 암호화</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Encrypted <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a></strong><small>KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> Key로 보호해 함께 저장</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Decrypt</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Encrypted <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a></strong><small>저장된 Key 암호문</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> Decrypt</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#key-policies-iam-and-grants\">Key Policy</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> 평가</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a> → Plaintext data</strong><small>앱에서 실제 데이터 복호화</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Key는 암호문의 위치를 찾는 주소가 아니라 암호 연산에 쓰는 값이다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"kms-keys-and-data-keys\"><h2>KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> Keys and Data Keys<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> Key는 관리 경계와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Key Material</a>을 가진다. GenerateDataKey는 지원 대칭 Key로 보호한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a>와 사용 가능한 Plaintext <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a>를 반환할 수 있다. 앱은 암호화 후 Plaintext Key를 안전하게 지우고 Encrypted <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a>를 보관한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"envelope-encryption\"><h2>Envelope Encryption<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#envelope-encryption\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a>로 데이터를 암호화하고 KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> Key로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a>를 암호화한다. 복호화할 때 보호된 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Data Key</a>를 KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span>로 풀고 실제 데이터를 복원한다. 큰 파일 전체를 KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 한 번에 보내는 모델과 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aws-owned-aws-managed-and-customer-managed-keys\"><h2>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Owned, AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Managed and Customer Managed Keys<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#aws-owned-aws-managed-and-customer-managed-keys\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#aws-owned-aws-managed-and-customer-managed-keys\">AWS Owned Key</a>는 고객 계정에서 직접 관리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#aws-owned-aws-managed-and-customer-managed-keys\">AWS Managed Key</a>는 서비스가 고객 계정에서 관리하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#aws-owned-aws-managed-and-customer-managed-keys\">Customer Managed Key</a>는 사용자가 Policy·Lifecycle을 제어한다. Cross-account 공유·회전·삭제 요구에 따라 선택한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"symmetric-asymmetric-and-hmac-keys\"><h2>Symmetric, Asymmetric and HMAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Hash-based Message Authentication Code)</span> Keys<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#symmetric-asymmetric-and-hmac-keys\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Symmetric Key는 Encryption·Decryption에, 지원 Asymmetric Key는 공개·비밀 Key 기반 암호화 또는 Sign·Verify에 사용한다. HMAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Hash-based Message Authentication Code)</span> Key는 MAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Media Access Control)</span> 생성·검증에 사용한다. Key Spec과 Usage가 서로 맞아야 하며 임의로 모든 연산을 혼용할 수 없다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"key-policies-iam-and-grants\"><h2>Key Policies, IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> and Grants<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#key-policies-iam-and-grants\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#key-policies-iam-and-grants\">Key Policy</a>는 Key 접근의 핵심 Resource Policy다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> 사용 허용과 Grants로 서비스의 필요한 사용 권한을 위임할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Object를 읽을 권한만 있고 KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> 권한이 없으면 암호화된 데이터 읽기가 실패할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"encryption-context\"><h2>Encryption Context<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#encryption-context\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>암호화 요청에 추가하는 비밀이 아닌 Key-value Context다. 복호화 때 일치 조건과 Policy 조건으로 데이터 용도를 제한할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>에 기록될 수 있으므로 Password 같은 민감정보를 넣지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"key-rotation-and-aliases\"><h2>Key Rotation and Aliases<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#key-rotation-and-aliases\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Key 유형은 자동·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-demand</a> Rotation을 제공하며 과거 Ciphertext 복호화에 필요한 이전 Material을 유지한다. Alias는 사람이 이해하기 쉬운 Key 참조 이름이다. Alias 변경이 기존 Ciphertext를 새 Key로 자동 재암호화하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"multi-region-keys\"><h2>Multi-Region Keys<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#multi-region-keys\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>연관된 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Key Material</a>을 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에서 사용하게 하는 지원 Key 모델이다. 각 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 Policy·Alias·상태는 별도로 관리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#multi-region-keys\">Multi-Region Key</a>가 데이터 자체를 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>으로 복제하는 기능은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"imported-material-and-custom-key-stores\"><h2>Imported Material and Custom Key Stores<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#imported-material-and-custom-key-stores\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#kms-keys-and-data-keys\">Key Material</a>을 가져오거나 CloudHSM·External Key Store 기반 제어를 사용할 수 있다. 가용성·운영·연결 책임이 늘어난다. 외부 Key 공급이 끊기면 해당 데이터 암복호화에도 영향이 생길 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"disable-deletion-and-audit\"><h2>Disable, Deletion and Audit<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#disable-deletion-and-audit\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Key Disable은 사용을 막고 Scheduled Deletion은 대기 기간 뒤 복구 불가능한 손실을 만들 수 있다. 삭제 전에 해당 Key로 보호된 데이터·Backup을 확인한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>로 Key 사용과 관리 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 감사한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 데이터와 Backup을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#aws-owned-aws-managed-and-customer-managed-keys\">Customer Managed Key</a>로 보호하면 데이터 권한과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#key-policies-iam-and-grants\">Key Policy</a>를 함께 관리한다. Cross-account Restore에서는 대상 계정의 Key 사용 권한까지 검증한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span> 키는 암호문이 저장된 파일의 주소를 찾는 색인 키라는 뜻이 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/developerguide/overview.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">kms/latest/developerguide/overview.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q064/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q064\" data-question=\"Q064\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q064</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q064/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to control and audit use of a customer-managed encryption key for S3 server-side encryption. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q064\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q064\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q064\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q064\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#encryption\">SSE-KMS</a> 같은 방식으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> 키 사용 권한과 감사 범위를 제어한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q065\" data-question=\"Q065\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q065</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q065/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to store an application database password outside its code and rotate it periodically. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q065\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a KMS key alias</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q065\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q065\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q065\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Secrets Manager</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a>는 비밀 값의 저장·조회·교체에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q089\" data-question=\"Q089\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q089</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q089/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to use a role to access an S3 bucket in another account. Which TWO permission areas should it review?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only NAT gateway availability</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The role trust policy and permission to call AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The target bucket policy and the role&#x27;s S3 permissions</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, E</strong> · 교차 계정 역할을 맡을 수 있어야 하고, 맡은 뒤 리소스 액세스 정책도 맞아야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q061\" data-question=\"Q061\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q061</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q061/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application on EC2 needs S3 access. Instead of embedding a long-term access key in the AMI, what should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Embed the root account key</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Make the S3 bucket public</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an IAM role to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in the network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 역할을 통한 임시 자격 증명과 최소 권한 정책이 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q088\" data-question=\"Q088\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q088</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q088/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Lambda functions connect to a private RDS database. Which TWO services address connection spikes and secure storage of credentials?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Route 53 weighted record</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Secrets Manager</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Proxy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a>는 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 연결을 풀링하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a>는 비밀 값을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/\">이전 용어 <b>Kinesis Data Streams</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">다음 용어 <b>Lambda</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
